    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[ K-IG 교육- 205]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(Jeju Island and Mt. Halla)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "Perhaps the most famous natural wonder of Korea is"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "an island called Jeju."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Jeju island is my favorite place to go for vacation."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "There are so many fun things to do there"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "and many beautiful spots to visit."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I like going to Mt. Halla."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "It is in the center of Jeju island and is really high."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Mt. Halla is the highest mountain in South Korea;"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "it’s almost 2,000 meters high (about 6500 feet)."
    },
